  "releaseNotes": "Pair once: the pairing token persists in TokenFile, so a phone reconnects by itself; RepairAsync issues a new one. DisconnectPhoneAsync now puts the receiver on hold (IsOnHold) and ConnectPhone brings the phone back without a QR scan; PhoneWaiting fires when a phone is ready to return. New PhoneMode.Document saves shots to DocumentFolder and raises DocumentSaved. The pairing QR code carries the Payrite logo in its centre; QrLogo replaces or removes it, QrLogoSize resizes it.",
